{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/692f09d03b66a20134fc1823d10ee698.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/692f09d03b66a20134fc1823d10ee698.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s most accurate life simulator returns in Walk of Life! You\u2019re late for work, rent is overdue, and your refrigerator is literally on fire! Do you have what it takes to remember to eat every week? Dive headfirst into the chaotic rat race and crush your friends in Walk of Life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/58fd7f041cdcb1c98b26a198c11baa0e.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your best to juggle your health, education, career and personal hygiene, all while dodging the hilarious curveballs life throws your way! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or the AI in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who\u2019s the champion in the ultimate game of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2a1928582bafdd908c0c937cf9a07aab.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2a1928582bafdd908c0c937cf9a07aab.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/3509de6638b7f6fa503de9bd33280435.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opulence! The artistry! The swag! Decorate your apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams \u2018success in life\u2019 like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! How multifaceted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/7311a883467870048594f98b39252d86.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/7311a883467870048594f98b39252d86.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/5376efa6a3608ba70923b69dc02b361e.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new ways to approach the game! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/6406757337248553fb30dbe044cf46a0.avif?t=1770815510\" width=763 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/b97a4201c7adb64e2313ef07fa3238cc.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid gameplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just take a look the animations on the pawn shop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/ff9c55d7a4b3315d8b07953713a0800d.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/ff9c55d7a4b3315d8b07953713a0800d.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Baby Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/97e96bc70a76c05b11a92aa57ff03a9d4f7fe18c.jpg"},{"name":"Basket Case","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/b81839922a6f215d29bca6a0359e94908e254dfa.jpg"},{"name":"Beast Ascended","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/d94a58a211a2aca8703a30006afe0e81665638c5.jpg"},{"name":"Couch Potato","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/bb31029703799d0bf270ce624a8569f4ecf3789d.jpg"},{"name":"Destroy Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/eca1aaa68518495c0c9c9e7248121380917fa268.jpg"},{"name":"Don\u2019t Stop Believing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/44845fe521eb33e3c3ccd7dcf8ff47f7b6423bd8.jpg"},{"name":"Dress for the job you want","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/99fcdda7147b32c70d0f87bc00c542c3cc586150.jpg"},{"name":"Enter Sandman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/9629c3b1c30aa8f7e46a3b23caf7910848c68920.jpg"},{"name":"Fire? I hardly even know her","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/3835e9d7a7b89a25db12858880c2c4ef3bb6fc06.jpg"},{"name":"For a Biblical Flood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1910150/38b742445f1a52f8b6b228d1e5dad32109b445f6.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1910150?t=1770815510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770815510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/2db08f9701859ad824e94e6dbcb271876b79b71a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770815510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/2db08f9701859ad824e94e6dbcb271876b79b71a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770815510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/abcad77cd74b05fb37e842c7fa65c0b7.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1008 height=1575 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/692f09d03b66a20134fc1823d10ee698.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/692f09d03b66a20134fc1823d10ee698.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s most accurate life simulator returns in Walk of Life! You\u2019re late for work, rent is overdue, and your refrigerator is literally on fire! Do you have what it takes to remember to eat every week? Dive headfirst into the chaotic rat race and crush your friends in Walk of Life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/58fd7f041cdcb1c98b26a198c11baa0e.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your best to juggle your health, education, career and personal hygiene, all while dodging the hilarious curveballs life throws your way! Will you be a fry cook, a bank manager, or simply rely on the lottery for your income? Compete against friends or the AI in a series of boardgame-inspired turns to determine who\u2019s the champion in the ultimate game of life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2a1928582bafdd908c0c937cf9a07aab.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2a1928582bafdd908c0c937cf9a07aab.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/3509de6638b7f6fa503de9bd33280435.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opulence! The artistry! The swag! Decorate your apartment to flex your material wealth! Nothing screams \u2018success in life\u2019 like a sleek designer couch and a weaponized robot vacuum to protect it from covetous intruders! Leave your friends in awe as you transform your apartment into a veritable Shangri-La of consumer products! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also be able to express yourself in the literal sense! How multifaceted!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/7311a883467870048594f98b39252d86.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/7311a883467870048594f98b39252d86.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/5376efa6a3608ba70923b69dc02b361e.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new ways to approach the game! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/6406757337248553fb30dbe044cf46a0.avif?t=1770815510\" width=763 height=323 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/b97a4201c7adb64e2313ef07fa3238cc.avif?t=1770815510\" width=780 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid gameplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just take a look the animations on the pawn shop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/ff9c55d7a4b3315d8b07953713a0800d.poster.avif?t=1770815510\" width=1170 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/ff9c55d7a4b3315d8b07953713a0800d.webm?t=1770815510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Porcelain Fortress"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/header.jpg?t=1770815510","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Walk of Life \u00a9 Porcelain Fortress ehf. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nWalk of Life is a registered trademark of Porcelain Fortress ehf.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1, Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 GPU, AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Drive</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  macOS 15 Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Pro, Intel Core i5-12400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 Pro GPU, AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Drive</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1910150/927362158/9984c4ab797b96d6d31de2103b8e671cfdb13c04/1761320865/dash_av1.mpd?t=176132